OL,3,GNEWSAMental health charity sponsors
OL,4,Afootball club shirts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Maidenhead has said she
OL,7,F"wouldn't still be here" if it was not
OL,8,Ffor the partnership between a local
OL,9,Ffootball club and a national mental
OL,10,Fhealth charity.
OL,12,FClaire Smith said she was "completely
OL,13,Fisolated" after becoming too depressed
OL,14,Fand anxious to leave her house.
OL,16,FShe said she was a "shell of a person"
OL,17,Fbefore deciding to attend a weekly walk
OL,18,Fput on by Maidenhead United Community
OL,19,FTrust, as part of the club's
OL,20,Fpartnership with the Campaign Against
OL,21,FLiving Miserably (CALM) charity.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
